msgstr "This stage is in the full game"

msgid "👥  購入済みの友達と遊ぶ"
msgstr "👥  Play with a friend who owns it"

msgid "友達が完全版を持っていれば、その人の部屋に入るだけで\n全ステージを一緒に遊べます。購入は要りません。"
msgstr "If your friend owns the full game, join their room to play\nevery stage together. You do not need to buy it."

msgid "↺  購入を復元する"
msgstr "↺  Restore purchase"

msgid "購入を復元する"
msgstr "Restore purchase"

msgid "機種変更や再インストールのあとはこちら"
msgstr "Use this after changing devices or reinstalling"

msgid "▶  完全版を購入する（%s）"
msgstr "▶  Buy full game (%s)"

msgid "▶  完全版を購入する（価格を読み込み中…）"
msgstr "▶  Buy full game (loading price…)"

msgid "このビルドではストアに接続できません。"
msgstr "This build cannot connect to the store."

