msgstr "Nobody is in this room yet.\nCheck that your friend created a room\nand that every digit of the code matches."

msgid "\n\n下の「接続診断」を押すと、原因を調べて\nコピーできる記録を出します。"
msgstr "\n\nTap Connection log below to investigate\nand copy a diagnostic report."

msgid "購入済みの友達の部屋には、このままでも入れます。"
msgstr "You can still join a room hosted by a friend who owns it."

